<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>家庭净水器选购指南</title>
<style>
    body {
        background-color: #f27272;
        background-image: linear-gradient(180deg, #f27272 0%, #f7aaaa 60%, #111111 100%);
        margin: 0;
        padding: 40px 15px;
        font-family: "PingFang SC", "Microsoft YaHei", -apple-system, sans-serif;
        min-height: 100vh;
        box-sizing: border-box;
    }
    .container {
        background-color: #ffffff;
        border-radius: 12px;
        padding: 30px 25px;
        max-width: 540px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        box-shadow: 0 10px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
        box-sizing: border-box;
    }
    .main-title {
        color: #ef4545;
        font-size: 36px;
        font-weight: 900;
        text-align: center;
        margin: 0;
        line-height: 1.2;
        letter-spacing: 1px;
    }
    .subtitle {
        color: #d87575;
        text-align: center;
        font-size: 13px;
        margin-top: 8px;
    }
    .separator-container {
        position: relative;
        margin: 25px -25px;
        height: 20px;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
    }
    .separator-container::before, .separator-container::after {
        content: '';
        position: absolute;
        width: 20px;
        height: 20px;
        background-color: #f38080; /* matches body background near this height */
        border-radius: 50%;
    }
    .separator-container::before {
        left: -10px;
    }
    .separator-container::after {
        right: -10px;
    }
    .dashed-line {
        flex-grow: 1;
        border-top: 1.5px dashed #f0b9b9;
        margin: 0 15px;
    }
    .content-section {
        padding-top: 10px;
    }
    .item-title {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        font-size: 16px;
        font-weight: bold;
        color: #222;
        margin-top: 25px;
        margin-bottom: 12px;
    }
    .check {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        width: 16px;
        height: 16px;
        background-color: #fce444;
        border: 1px solid #333;
        border-radius: 50%;
        font-size: 10px;
        color: #000;
        margin-right: 8px;
        flex-shrink: 0;
    }
    .item-desc {
        font-size: 14px;
        color: #333;
        line-height: 1.6;
        margin: 0;
        text-align: justify;
    }
    .table-wrapper {
        margin: 15px 0 5px 0;
    }
    table {
        width: 100%;
        border-collapse: collapse;
    }
    th, td {
        border: 1px solid #555;
        padding: 8px 4px;
        text-align: center;
        font-size: 13px;
    }
    th {
        background-color: #8f8f8f;
        color: #ffffff;
        font-weight: bold;
    }
    td {
        background-color: #f1f1f1;
        color: #111;
        font-weight: 500;
    }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="container">
    <h1 class="main-title">家庭净水器选购指南</h1>
    <div class="subtitle">@吃货万万岁</div>

    <div class="separator-container">
        <div class="dashed-line"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="content-section">
        <div class="item-title">
            <span class="check">✔</span>
            1.选RO反渗透净水器，别选超滤净水器
        </div>
        <p class="item-desc">
            超滤膜过滤精度只有0.01微米，而RO膜是0.0001微米。差距是100倍！所以一定要选RO反渗透！
        </p>

        <div class="item-title">
            <span class="check">✔</span>
            2.通量选大于800G的
        </div>
        <p class="item-desc">
            通量决定了出水速度，出水速度大后，净水器就不光可以饮水，还可以洗碗、洗水果、煲汤等
        </p>
        <div class="table-wrapper">
            <table>
                <tr>
                    <th>通量</th>
                    <th>400G</th>
                    <th>600G</th>
                    <th>800G</th>
                    <th>1000G</th>
                    <th>1200G</th>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>出水速度</td>
                    <td>1L/min</td>
                    <td>1.5L/min</td>
                    <td>2L/min</td>
                    <td>2.5L/min</td>
                    <td>3L/min</td>
                </tr>
            </table>
        </div>

        <div class="item-title">
            <span class="check">✔</span>
            3.最好选0添加0阻垢剂0陈水的
        </div>
        <p class="item-desc">
            阻垢剂并不能增强滤芯的过滤性能，也不能改善纯水的水质。同时，阻垢剂中的含磷物质还会造成水体营养化，所以尽量选择0阻垢剂的净水器；0陈水的意思，就是不会储水。这样我们就不会喝到隔夜水了~每天清晨的第一杯水不需要倒掉。
        </p>

        <div class="item-title">
            <span class="check">✔</span>
            4.空间小选无桶，预算低选有桶
        </div>
        <p class="item-desc">
            净水器有桶无桶其实都可以！有桶也不会造成细菌污染（都是无桶商家踩出来的）。所以，你根据实际场景选！空间小选无桶，预算低选有桶。
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

</body>
</html>
```
